<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I felt sick.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed I'd gotten a little carsick.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"We're about 10 minutes from the inn, but want me to pull over so you can rest?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm fine... if it's only about 10 minutes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't usually get carsick, but I'd been looking at my phone the whole time, and this is what happened.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I had talked about the eye color that had changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that it kept bugging me, so I'd been studying my own eye closely with my phone's camera, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, that's an easy way to bring on carsickness.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館外観2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―We made it to the inn safely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouldn't feel any worse than this now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got out of the car and breathed in a bellyful of sea wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, riding that momentum, I blew out all the nasty <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しょうき">foul air</STYLE> that had built up in my stomach in one go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The nausea drained smoothly away, and I could feel the color coming back to my face.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "235" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
The inn we'd arrived at was a really grand place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">My mom</STYLE> sure splurged...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So, what should we do now? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a little awkward after all... 
{PAUSE ""}
Or rather, it felt weird.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or rather, it felt nothing but weird.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or rather, it was embarrassing...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, calling me 'Mom'... You can keep things the way they've always been, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right, right, same as always."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ha, ha ha ha... yeah, you're right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Oh! I'm gonna go explore the inn by myself for a bit!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I wanted to settle my feelings, so I left the room by myself.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm glad <STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE> set up a chance like this, but I don't know what to do...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, it's not every day I'm at a luxury inn, so I'll have a good look around.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\日々と泉.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I came up to the third floor, where the banquet halls were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seemed to be a wedding going on right then.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\結婚式.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In front of a banquet hall with its doors shut, a bride and groom in Japanese dress stood facing the doors.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Were they about to make their entrance?<PG>
Behind the bride and groom were two people who looked like the groom's parents, and one who seemed to be the bride's mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had happened to the bride's father?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a moment I put myself in the bride's place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still can't picture it, but will I also find a life partner and see a day like this?<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">My dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE>, believe it or not, decided to get married the day after they met, apparently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">My dad</STYLE> may have looked like that, but he sure was quick to make his move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Geez, your face is joke enough...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I said that in front of <STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE> once, and I remember her getting genuinely angry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the only time she ever got that angry with me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Next I came to the second floor, the restaurant floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\宴会.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館渡り廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Even though it was indoors, a stream ran along the corridor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't drunk people ever fall in?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="7">my dad</STYLE> were alive, he'd probably have slipped and fallen in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Breaking his leg in the middle of a hunt, falling out of a tree and dying... from what I've heard, he was a guy with no end of epic klutz stories.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館ラウンジ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館宴会.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was already past 2 p.m., but every restaurant still had groups enjoying their meals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More of a banquet than a meal, maybe. Cheerful, rowdy voices echoed all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, along the corridor, there was a wide tatami seating area, raised up off the floor. The group having a banquet there all stood up at once.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\万歳.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What were the banzai cheers for?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Old people were doing their best to swing up arms that looked hard to raise.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, I get being excited when you come to a luxury inn like this.<PG>
Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was still a bad drunk, same as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What about <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In another 4 and a half years, <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> will turn 20 too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, sure enough, will we have drinking parties too?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi's dad</STYLE> loves to drink, so that's probably unavoidable.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My prediction is that the worst drunk will probably be <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> will probably be a crying drunk?<PG>
Well, that's about it for this banquet floor... I mean, restaurant floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The fourth floor and up are guest rooms, so I can't really wander around there, which leaves the first floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I sat down on a sofa in the first-floor lobby.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Big inn or not, 15 minutes was enough to see most of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could check out the souvenir shop, but that could just as well wait until tomorrow.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">Come to think of it, </STYLE>what was <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> up to?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the amusement park with her family by now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might be a bother, but maybe I'll give her a call just to tease her...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
No answer...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she's somewhere noisy like an amusement park, she might not notice...<PG>
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Aw, man... what do I do now...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not like I dislike <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> parents...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, but frankly, the mood here is awkward!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I said something like that, they'd probably forgive me, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Aw, man... what do I do?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Whoa, it's <STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE>, right on cue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She went to the trouble of calling me back.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, hellooo?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hiii! It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> Goto-chan!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"How's it going over there? You at the amusement park yet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Almost! We just got off the expressway. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what about you? Aren't you with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Nah, it's... how do I put it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"So it's awkward with the Kogori parents after all?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, yeah... I just don't know how to act around them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Figures. In a situation like that, even this genius girl would be stumped..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Being a genius has nothing to do with it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Anyway, that's how it is, so right now I'm in the inn lobby by myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's just no use..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"With that kind of thing, isn't it fine to just keep things the way they've always been?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　There's no need to change all of a sudden. Don't you think you'll naturally </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="なじ">settle in</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know that, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went out of her way to set this up, having nothing change at all is kinda..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Like I said, I get how you feel, but I think forcing yourself like that is exactly what's no good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> family and you, having a fun time together―isn't that enough? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">That'll be the best story to bring home."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahh, I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Just enjoy things however I like, and if I can tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> about it, that's enough... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah, you're right about that!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Got it! I'll head back to the room. Sorry for bugging you on your trip."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"No, no, it's me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, right? Please don't be such a stranger!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had a feeling <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> had her hands on her hips on the other end of the line.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then once I get to the amusement park, I'll show off over a video call!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　I'll show you some super amazing rides!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hahaha, I'll look forward to it! Okay, you have fun over there too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Okay!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When it counts, <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> really is reliable.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's simple, but: stay natural, the way I always have been.<PG>
I got on the elevator to go back to our room's floor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Huh? Which floor was it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shoot...! I forgot which floor our room's on...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I'll try calling <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
No answer...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Asking <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> parents would be a little lame, so I'll ask at the front desk.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Excuse me, I'm Niimura... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">no, Kogori, but which room was mine again...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Yes, Kogori-sama. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Kogori-sama is―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
