<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> asking, <STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="・">, you're lost too</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE> means...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So, what about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
