<STYLE ID="1">"Me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Um, well, I was out looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> cheeks went pink with embarrassment.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah-hah. I know what's up! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> got lost too, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Oh, yeah, that's... right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We laughed together a little.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, wanna take a little walk outside? The sea's close, and the weather's nice."</STYLE><PG>
