We talked on a stretch of shore that looked down over the sea, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About 10 years ago, about us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About what we should do to build happiness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a relief that our thinking didn't seem to differ much.<PG>
If <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> is ever about to make a mistake, I'll stop her with everything I've got.
{PAUSE ""}
